{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/59f8ae60829b61080a2c5f8f76100df7.avif?t=1753818166\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 puzzles involving orientation and size illusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surreal display with impossible fractals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience Non-Euclidean rooms that cannot exist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a bizarre curved geometry where perspective is flipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive soundtrack setting the surreal tone of the game</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Geodyssey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Geodyssey</strong> is a <strong>mind-bending</strong> <strong>surreal</strong> <strong>adventure</strong> <strong>game</strong> that challenges your perception with perplexing <i>Escher-like</i> environments. Explore spaces that defy logic, and experience a reality that cannot exist. A game that subverts expectations, and turns the familiar into something perplexing. <strong>Experience the perplexing impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/f8a9fee2c5c8618713d5546a4396a88e.avif?t=1753818166\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo features a bizarre geometry that cannot exist in real world. The world that distort your vision, sense of depth. Explore the world that warps, twists, and bends as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/30c5bb49a8048cda197de8810cbfb0ad.poster.avif?t=1753818166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/30c5bb49a8048cda197de8810cbfb0ad.webm?t=1753818166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/30c5bb49a8048cda197de8810cbfb0ad.mp4?t=1753818166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/0e501e178165210c9108c81b2fc4aa6f.avif?t=1753818166\" /></div>Navigate through upside-down doors that twist your sense of orientation. Pass through bizarrely sized doors, only to realise that the world beyond has transformed in size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/cc232ae91d0d00ea48a9879132f5a03c.poster.avif?t=1753818166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/cc232ae91d0d00ea48a9879132f5a03c.webm?t=1753818166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/cc232ae91d0d00ea48a9879132f5a03c.mp4?t=1753818166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extras/a0e6bf481d29a784e1836b3bdebe13dd.avif?t=1753818166\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through infinite corridors, and rooms that bizarrely interconnect in ways you can never expect. Experience what's not possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893550/extra